#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Tsy manana fahazoan-dalana amin'ny fitaovan'io cluster io ianao."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Anarana: efa misy cluster hafa mampiasa io anarana io."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Tsy voatahiry ny cluster: novan'olon-kafa izany hatramin'ny nanokafana ny taratasy fenoina, na tsy nahomby ny fanoratana. Sokafy indray ary avereno ny fanovana."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Voatahiry ny cluster."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Tsy niova ny toetry ny cluster: tsy nahomby ny fanoratana. Jereo ny firaketana Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Voafafa ny cluster sy ny snapshot voatahiry tao amin'ny cache. Notazonina ny fitaovana sy ny grafikany. Tsy nifandraisana ny scheduler."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Voaforona ny fitaovana sy ny grafikany."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Tsy voaforona ny fitaovana: efa manana fitaovana ny cluster, novan'olon-kafa izany hatramin'ny nanokafana ny pejy, na nolavin'ny Cacti izany. Jereo ny firaketana Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Nampifandraisina tamin'ny fitaovana ny cluster."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Tsy nampifandraisina ny cluster: tsy misy ilay fitaovana, tsy nahazoana alalana ho anao, efa mitondra cluster hafa, na novan'olon-kafa ny cluster hatramin'ny nanokafana ny pejy."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Nampiana ireo grafika tsy ampy."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Tsy nisy grafika nampiana: tsy manana fitaovana ny cluster, na tsy misy intsony ny fitaovany."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Tsy tapaka ny fifandraisan'ny cluster: novan'olon-kafa izany hatramin'ny nanokafana ny pejy."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Tapaka ny fifandraisan'ny cluster. Notazonina ny fitaovana sy ny grafikany."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Naverina nohavaozina ny fanondroana ireo partition avy amin'ny snapshot."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Tsy naverina nohavaozina ny fanondroana ireo partition: nosakanana na tsy azo ifandraisana ny fitaovana, ka nodinganin'ny Cacti ny fangatahana rakitra."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Tsy naverina nohavaozina ny fanondroana ireo partition: tsy nahavita nandefa ny fangatahana rakitra ny Cacti. Jereo ny firaketana Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Tsy naverina nohavaozina ny fanondroana ireo partition: tsy napetraka ny fangatahana rakitra HPC Scheduler. Apetraho avy ao amin'ny pejin'ny fahasalamana ireo modely."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Tsy naverina nohavaozina ny fanondroana ireo partition: tsy manana fitaovana ny cluster, na tsy misy intsony ny fitaovany."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Napetraka ireo modely HPC Scheduler."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Tsy napetraka ireo modely: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Fomba fijery fanaraha-maso"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Tsy azo novakiana ny fandinihana. Angataho ny mpitantana hanamarina ny firaketana ny plugin."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Jereo ao amin'ny topimaso ireo sokajin-antony miandry sy ny fahavaozan'ny snapshot. Ampitao any amin'ny mpitantana ny mombamomba ny fanamarinana, ny fifandraisana cluster ary ny politikam-pikojakojana."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Anarana: mampiasà litera, isa, teboka, tsipika kely, na tsipika ambany miisa 1 ka hatramin'ny 64, manomboka amin'ny litera na isa."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: mifidiana iray amin'ireo poller voatanisa."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana fanangonana: ampidiro segondra feno manomboka amin'ny %d ka hatramin'ny %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Fomba fifandraisana: misafidiana iray amin'ireo fomba fifandraisana voatanisa."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: ampidiro lalana feno, na avelao ho banga mba hampiasana ny an'ny poller tsotra."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: tsy ao anatin'ny lisitry ny mpampiantrano slurmrestd ao amin'ny Fikirakirana ity mpampiantrano sy seranana ity."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: ampidiro URL https:// tsy misy anaran'ny mpampiasa, fangatahana (query), na ampahany (fragment); ekena ihany ny http:// tsotra ho an'ny adiresy loopback."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Mpampiasa slurmrestd: mampiasà litera, isa, teboka, tsipika kely, na tsipika ambany fara fahabetsany 64, na avelao ho banga ho an'ny token mpampiasa."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Rakitra Token: ampidiro ny lalana feno an'ny rakitra token ao amin'ny poller. Tsy ampidirina eto mihitsy ny tena token."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Rakitra Token: mbola tsy misy lahatahiry rakitra token napetraka. Angataho ny mpitantana Cacti hametraka izany ao amin'ny Fikirakirana, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Rakitra Token: tsy maintsy ao anatin'ny iray amin'ireo lahatahiry rakitra token napetraka ao amin'ny Fikirakirana (%s) ny rakitra."

