#: lib/ClustersPage.php
msgid "Client commands use the binaries set under Settings > HPC Scheduler and the poller user's own Slurm authentication; the optional slurm.conf path selects a cluster. slurmrestd fields are used only with that transport. The token file must be readable by the poller user only; the plugin reads it at each run and never stores the token."
msgstr "Mampiasa ireo programa napetraka ao amin'ny Fikirakirana > HPC Scheduler sy ny fanamarinana Slurm an'ny mpampiasa poller ny baiko mpanjifa; ny lalana slurm.conf tsy voatery no misafidy cluster. Ampiasaina miaraka amin'io fomba fifandraisana io ihany ireo saha slurmrestd. Ny mpampiasa poller ihany no tokony hahavaky ny rakitra token; mamaky azy isaky ny mandeha ny plugin ary tsy mitahiry ny token mihitsy."

