#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum Answer Size is %d MiB, but a decoded answer of that size does not fit in the Collection Memory of %d MiB; the reader allows %d MiB. Raise Collection Memory or lower Maximum Answer Size in Settings."
msgstr "Ny Haben'ny Valiny Fara Fahabetsany dia %d MiB, fa ny valiny voavaha amin'io habe io dia tsy tafiditra ao anatin'ny Fitadidiana Fanangonana %d MiB; ny mpamaky dia mamela %d MiB. Ampiakaro ny Fitadidiana Fanangonana na ampidino ny Haben'ny Valiny Fara Fahabetsany ao amin'ny Fikirakirana."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Assigned to poller %d, a remote data collector. This release collects only on the main poller, so the cluster is not collected; remote collection is planned for phase 3. Assign it to the main poller."
msgstr "Voatendry ho an'ny poller %d, mpanangona rakitra lavitra. Ity dikan-teny ity dia manangona ao amin'ny poller fototra ihany, ka tsy angonina ny cluster; ny fanangonana lavitra dia nomanina ho amin'ny dingana faha-3. Atokàny ho an'ny poller fototra izy."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval is below the %d second floor."
msgstr "Latsaky ny fetra ambany %d segondra ny elanelam-potoana fanangonana."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval of %d seconds is shorter than the poller interval of %d seconds; data is collected every %d seconds."
msgstr "Ny elanelam-potoana fanangonana %d segondra dia fohy kokoa noho ny elanelam-potoana poller %d segondra; angonina isaky ny %d segondra ny rakitra."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "slurmrestd is reached over plain HTTP on the loopback address; the token crosses the local network stack unencrypted."
msgstr "Azo ifandraisana amin'ny alalan'ny HTTP tsotra amin'ny adiresy loopback ny slurmrestd; mandalo tsy voarakotra ao amin'ny tambajotra eo an-toerana ny token."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "No reader run has finished for this cluster yet."
msgstr "Mbola tsy nisy fampandehanana mpamaky vita ho an'ity cluster ity."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token file: %s."
msgstr "Rakitra token: %s."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The token expired %s."
msgstr "Lany andro %s ny token."

